          "text": "Cilengano ncindakabona cakali mbuli cilengano eco, ncindakabwene naakasika kuzoonyonyoona munzi, mbuli cilengano ncindakabona kumulonga wa-Kebara. Mpawo ndakavundama ansi. ",
