        {
          "text": "Wakandaambila kuti, O mwana amuntu, mboobuno busena bwacuuno cangu cabwami abusena bwazituta zyamaulu aangu, nkonzookala akati kabana ba-Israyeli lyoonse. Lino bantu baluzubo lwa-Israyeli tabakooyoosofwaazya limbi izina lyangu lisalala, balo nebaba bami babo, kubumambe bwabo amitunta yabami babo; ",
          "type": "text",
