        {
          "text": "kukubika zilyatililo zyabo kufwaafwi kuzilyatililo zyangu azikunguzyo zyabo kumbali lyazikunguzyo zyangu, abulambo bulike mbobutwaanzaanya, Basofwaazya izina lyangu lisalala kuzisesemyo zyabo nzebacita. Nciceeco ncendabanyonyweeda­ mubukali bwangu. ",
