        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobu cipaililo mbucibede. Kweelekwa, ceelekwa atukokola tupati, (kakokola nkokuti kakokola abwaamba bwajanza). Matako aaco ayooba kakokola komwe mubulamfu akakokola komwe mubwaamba, amoombe waco uyooba cisela cakakokola koonse koonse. Mbuboobo matako aacipaililo mbwaabede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi bwiime kuzwa ansi kusikila kucaanzikilo citaanzi bwakali tukokola tobile, abwaamba bwakali kakokola komwe, alimwi kuzwa kucaanzikilo ciniini kusikila kucaanzikilo cipati bwakali tukokola tone, abwaamba kakokola komwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aciko cacipaizyo ciyooba tukokola tone, alimwi kuzwa kuciko kuyooba meja one aaimvwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela ciko ciyooba tukokola tuli ikumi atubili mubulamfu atukokola tuli ikumi atubili mubwaamba; ciyooba azyooko zyone zyeelene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
