              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 20:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acaanzikilo ciyooba tukokola tuli ikumi atune mubulamfu atukokola tuli ikumi atune mubwaamba, cili azyooko zyone zyeelene; cilaba amoombe koonse koonse, uli abwaamba bwacisela cakakokola, atako lyaco lili akakokola komwe koonse koonse. Amatantilo aacipaililo ayoolanga kujwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
