        },
        {
          "text": "uleelede kupa bapaizi baLevi, basilunyungu ba-Zadoki, baswena kulindime kukundikutaukila, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova, mupoho wacipaizyo cazibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
