                  "text": "Job 42:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamane mazuba aali musanu aabili, lino kutalika mubuzuba bwamusanu aatatu bapaizi banootuula zipaizyo zyanu azituuzyo zyanu zyakutontozya acipaililo, nkabela njoomuswiilila, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova.",
